#### 4. Mystery Guest
**Ref:** Van Deursen et al. (2001); testsmells.org  
**Affected:** `ImportOrders_FromCsv_ParsesCorrectly` (line 140)

```csharp
var orders = processor.ImportOrders(
    File.ReadAllText(@"C:\TestData\orders.csv"));
```

**Risk:** Test depends on an external file at a hardcoded Windows path. Fails on any machine without that file, in CI, and on non-Windows OSes. Test intent is hidden — reader cannot see what input produces 5 orders.

**Fix:** Inline the test data:
```csharp
[TestMethod]
public void ImportOrders_FromCsv_ParsesCorrectly()
{
    var processor = new OrderProcessor(_db, _email, _inventory);
    const string csv = "SKU,Qty\nSKU-1,2\nSKU-2,1\nSKU-3,4\nSKU-4,1\nSKU-5,3";

    var orders = processor.ImportOrders(csv);

    Assert.AreEqual(5, orders.Count);
}
```

