### 🟢 LOW SEVERITY

#### 9. General Fixture (Over-broad Setup)
**Ref:** Van Deursen et al. (2001); testsmells.org  
**Affected:** Class-level `[TestInitialize]` (line 13)

```csharp
_logger = new FakeLogger();  // initialized but never referenced by any test
```

**Risk:** Every test pays construction cost for `_logger`. As the fixture grows with more unused fields, test setup becomes slower and harder to understand — readers must figure out which objects matter for each test.

**Fix:** Remove `_logger` from the shared fixture, or introduce it only in tests that need it via a local variable or a helper method.

